cff-version: 1.2.0
title: "fieldborders: Agricultural Field Boundaries from Sentinel-2 Time Series"
message: "If you use this software, please cite it as below."
type: software
authors:
  - family-names: Rahimi
    given-names: Ehsan
    orcid: "https://orcid.org/0000-0002-8401-472X"
  - family-names: Jung
    given-names: Chuleui
version: 1.0.0
license: GPL-3.0-or-later
repository-code: "https://github.com/ehsanrahimi666/fieldborders"
abstract: >-
  An R package that delineates agricultural fields from Sentinel-2 image time series.
  The temporal boundary contrast method ranks spectral bands and indices by how
  differently they change through the season across field borders and inside fields,
  learns an edge map and a cropland map, and turns them into field objects by
  marker-controlled watershed; the maps can be fused with the class probabilities of
  deep segmentation models.
keywords:
  - field boundaries
  - agriculture
  - Sentinel-2
  - remote sensing
  - time series
  - segmentation
